      "text": "① listing_module_router\n② listing_operations_for_modules\n③ listing_list_operations  [全部目录]\n④ listing_call(operation, arguments)\n\noperation 白名单 → Zod 参数校验 → handler\nMercado Libre：ml_native / ml_cbt\nAxios → ERP BFF；JSON / query / multipart",
