      "text": "/api/proxy/platform/*\n校验 ERP Bearer Token\nRBAC / 租户 / 店铺归属校验\n按平台接口路由转发\n\nshopId = ERP shops.id\n不是 Mercado Libre seller ID\n内部实现：本次未取得源码",
